<p><strong><span style="color: #bf1515;">Fizz</span></strong> is a cheerful resident of <strong>Voxel World</strong>, with the playful appearance of a cat and a blocky, square-shaped body. For him, <strong>flying isn&#39;t just a way to travel&mdash;it&rsquo;s part of his daily routine</strong> and something he loves. (And I often fly out from the window of my apartment, then check whether Blues is awake or not!)</p>

<p>His unique <strong>huge propeller backpack</strong> is his only decoration, but it plays a big role in his life. &nbsp;It has unlimited power, also light for him, and it features a temperature adjustment pad on its back, which allows him to feel warm or cool. His mind controls it, so he can decide when he can fly. &nbsp;And when he is excited or scared, the propeller will automatically spin! Thanks to it, Fizz is often the <strong>first customer to arrive at the store</strong>, especially when there&rsquo;s something new and exciting for him to grab! (I always wear my propeller all the time, though I often get stuck at the door...)</p>

<p>He loves drinking some fizzy soft drinks, most of which are sugar-free.</p>

<p>Fizz is optimistic, energetic, and loves to talk&mdash;sometimes for hours&mdash;especially when he&#39;s <strong>sharing food and conversations with his best friend,&nbsp;Blues</strong>. &nbsp;He likes Blues so much that he often launches into a joyful flying hug the moment they meet.</p>

<p>When he&#39;s out and about, Fizz enjoys <strong>exploring the world from the sky</strong>, snapping fun photos, and collecting something interesting from his travels around Voxel World.</p>

<p>With his flying ability and helping hands, he brings a lot of joy to those around him. <strong>He may be a bit silly at times, but that&rsquo;s part of his charm, and I truly love that about him!</strong></p>

